<div class="card gap">
	<div class="eyebrow">The gap</div>
	<h2>Your marketing is busy. Your revenue doesn't show it.</h2>
	<p>
		You're running ads, paying agencies, posting on social, and checking dashboards, and still
		walking into Monday without a clear answer to the only question that matters: <em>is any of this
		actually bringing in money?</em>
	</p>
	<p>
		Most $5M–$50M businesses don't have a marketing execution problem. They have a leadership gap.
		No one owns the strategy. Agencies stay busy but nobody connects their output to revenue. AI tools
		got added to the stack but nobody knows if they're helping. The budget grows. The clarity doesn't.
	</p>
</div>

<div class="card solution">
	<div class="eyebrow">Solution</div>
	<h2>That's the gap a fractional CMO closes.</h2>
	<p>
		I'm a fractional chief marketing officer and operator who uses AI as a multiplier, not a
		buzzword. I've built and run twelve companies. I know what a broken marketing function looks
		like from the inside, and I know how to fix it. Through my
		<a href="/services/fractional-cmo/">fractional CMO services</a>, I start with your business,
		build the strategy, align the execution, and use AI to make it move faster and cost less than
		any agency you've worked with.
	</p>
</div>

<style>
	.card {
		border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
		padding: 48px;
		margin-bottom: 24px;
	}
	.gap {
		background: var(--white);
		border: 1px solid var(--border);
	}
	.solution {
		background: var(--ink-950);
		color: #fff;
	}
	.eyebrow {
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-weight: 600;
		font-size: 12.5px;
		letter-spacing: 0.04em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: var(--orange-500);
		margin-bottom: 16px;
	}
	h2 {
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-weight: 500;
		font-size: 4rem;
		line-height: 1.1;
		margin: 0 0 20px;
		max-width: 760px;
	}
	.gap p {
		font-size: 16px;
		line-height: 1.65;
		color: var(--text-secondary);
		max-width: 760px;
		margin: 0 0 14px;
	}
	.gap p:last-child {
		margin-bottom: 0;
	}
	.solution p {
		font-size: 16px;
		line-height: 1.65;
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
		max-width: 700px;
		margin: 0;
	}
	@media (max-width: 640px) {
		.card {
			padding: 32px 24px;
		}
		h2 {
			font-size: 2.25rem;
			line-height: 1.15;
		}
	}
</style>
